  "instructions": [
    "Heat the rendered lamb fat in a large clay or ceramic tagine over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced onion and cook until it is softened and lightly browned.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the oysters and cook until they are lightly browned on the bottom.",
    "Add the chicken broth and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cook, covered, until the oysters are cooked through and the sauce has thickened.",
    "Stir in the chopped parsley and serve the tagine hot over couscous or rice."
